Features:
* High-speed wireless screen mirroring with ultra-low latency
* Synchronized stereo audio streaming between PC and phone
* Remote multi-display desktop view and touch controls
* Isolated Android application windowing on your PC desktop
* Automatic zero-configuration network discovery via UDP beacons
* Bidirectional notification sync and remote control
